WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,860
Wenxi, it’s quiet here

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:12,080
Stay as long as you want. Don't be polite to me. There are rooms upstairs. I'll carry your bags for you.

3
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:19,700
You, you are not busy with the club, who is she?

4
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,940
Brother, please speak better

5
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,420
My hiking teammate Vincent

6
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,580
Yunqi thank you

7
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,460
I'm going to stay in a hotel

8
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,460
I still have some money on me

9
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,580
Can last for a week

10
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,980
You have to thank me for not picking up a bow and arrow on the spur of the moment

11
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:34,340
Otherwise, I’ll put you two on the wall and Batuba won’t be able to stand down.

12
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:35,900
Brother, Vincent had a fight with his father

13
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,060
So you want to be his father

14
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,260
No wonder Lin Jing really ignored you.

15
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,340
You deserve to be single

16
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,380
Vincent, let's go

17
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,020
Isn't this the little fat guy?

18
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,660
My brother and Lin Jingque’s Q board

19
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:55,940
Dad wants a bag

20
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,380
Dad's cloud bag

21
00:00:59,130 --> 00:01:00,170
Dad wants a bag

22
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:01,450
My favorite cloud package

23
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,360
Vincent, put the suitcase away

24
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,560
You go first, I have something else to do

25
00:01:07,310 --> 00:01:08,230
You won't leave

26
00:01:08,630 --> 00:01:10,110
I might not be able to sleep

27
00:01:10,110 --> 00:01:11,190
Still want to chat with you

28
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:12,270
Come on, go, go, go
